{
  "metadata": {
    "name": "Mushroom Keychain - Black & White Three-Phase",
    "model": "claude-fable-5",
    "created_at": "2026-07-10T00:00:00.000Z",
    "description": "Three-phase build per design review. PHASE 1: sculpt the cap. PHASE 2: undercut - flat slice at Z=19 (removes the ellipsoid's curled-under wall, the proven root cause of the shattering cap), then a bell hollowed into the flat face (ceiling Z=21.4, opening r~12.2, flat rim ring ~3.2mm), then remesh 0.25mm + smooth. PHASE 3: the 13 white warts are added AFTER all smoothing so they cannot be erased (the previous version smoothed them flat) - kept as separate white shells over the finished red head. Colors: red cap, white spots + stem. Exports one aligned STL per color."
  },
